mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\ninstagram-seo is the **IG keyword-search layer** — research the queries and write the keyworded caption (and\nadvise the profile labels + visual signals) that make a post rank in Instagram search. The agent **researches\n+ writes the search-first caption + specs the on-screen/spoken keyword + advises the profile/alt text**;\n**WoopSocial publishes the caption**; **the Name field, handle, bio, alt text, category, and auto-captions are\nnative/advised**, and on-screen text/audio come from other tools/the creator.\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** researches keywords (**advises the method** — top-Reel scan + competitor Name fields + Google\n  PAA — and **never fabricates volume**), writes the **search-first caption** (`content.text`, primary keyword\n  first, **no stuffing**, 3–5 hashtag labels), **specs the on-screen text + first-3-sec spoken keyword**, and\n  **advises** the Name field/handle/bio/alt text/category.\n- **WoopSocial publishes** the IG post's **caption** (POST/REEL/STORY via `content.text`) — the publishable\n  SEO surface.\n- **WoopSocial does NOT:** set the **Name field/handle/bio** (profile — native), set **alt text** (native/\n  at-post), set the **category/location** (native), toggle **auto-captions** (native), read **IG Search/\n  Insights** (native), render the **on-screen text** (image/video tool), or record the **spoken audio**\n  (creator/`reels-script`).\n- **No keyword stuffing** (suppressed); **no irrelevant/clickbait hashtags** (hurt credibility); the **caption\n  must MATCH the visual** (Computer Vision — no misleading); **remove other-platform watermarks**; **never\n  fabricate volume or rankings.** **Verify-quarterly.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **instagram-seo (this)** — **IG-specific** keyword search (Name field, closed-system + Google-indexed,\n  Computer Vision caption-visual match, first-3-sec spoken keyword).\n- **social-seo** — the **cross-cutting** platform-search framework (TikTok/IG/YouTube/Pinterest broadly); this\n  is the IG depth.\n- **pinterest-seo** — **Pinterest's** keyword search (boards, Trends, Rich Pins; an open, web-indexed,\n  DA-94 system) — a different platform.\n- **hashtag-strategy** — IG **deprioritized hashtags** to 3–5; **they pair** (tags label, keywords discover).\n- **caption-writer** — the **caption craft**; this is the **search-optimization** of it (they pair).\n- **instagram-growth** — the IG **account strategy**; **reels-script** — the **Reel script** (this specs the\n  spoken/on-screen keyword). **ai-search-optimization** — being cited by **AI engines** (IG content is now\n  indexed → can be cited).\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (niche/voice), the **post topic/destination.**\n- **Pairs with:** `caption-writer` (the caption), `hashtag-strategy` (the 3–5 labels), `reels-script` (the\n  first-3-sec spoken keyword), `ideogram`/the video tools (the on-screen text overlay).\n- **Routes to/from:** `instagram-growth` (the strategy), `social-seo`/`ai-search-optimization` (the\n  cross-platform + AI search picture), `content-recycling` (re-cut a winning Reel into a keyworded carousel).\n- **Publishes via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (the caption; POST/REEL/STORY) +\n  `platform-specs-and-validation`. **Measures with:** native **IG Insights** + `analytics-and-reporting`\n  (profile visits from search, saves, reach from non-followers). **Profile, alt text, settings + IG Search\n  stay native/human.**\n"
